<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTIUS</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim.</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Weraung We Kodu Na Paulusi We Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Weraung We Kodu Na Paulusi We</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTIUSI</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio Aduna we 2 Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="ip">Timotiusi mamo Paulusi ne pandura we aimiomang rai. Weraung nini Paulusi soi we denyau Timotiusi we nukepana na wiuwu kawio parari Sen Yesus Kristusi na wemai kong riu Allai ne Kawiopa na wemai konta. I tato derekamang Timotiusi we dong pararia pampang mariwa nempa we mantanyau pa kong we nyontarai wiuwu Arera we Wieng na Allai pa, mae imbaro miunuara na awe dedu didiwa pa kong nyontarai engkangkani pa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi derekamang Timotiusi tato we remo pendura kong nyontarai embateta ya parari kawio kio ateta toyana pa pe. Wo kawio toyana pa kio wemai peawa, mana kio piwe unawa pa we nyontarai entaraoa paya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Parari pitau yana pa Paulusi derekamang Timotius we kio sanyawa na mantauni, aino parari rioao we Kristusi pa, anewiwu nyontarai pa, kong parari miunuara na didiwa deduta pa na awe engkangkani pa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na awe Paulusi denatua ne weraung nei nini pa, i wiata na wangka rarong pai na bendari Roma, demamang we dedu mamba pa pina. Na weraung we Paulusi soipa, weraung nini pai mamo weraung we pui pina.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kawio na weraung nei kiutua tonina:</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio retenang. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi deparanding Allai kong derekamang Timotiusi imbaro riupi we Seni na wemai pampang. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1:3-18</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 3:1-17">3:1-17</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:1-8">4:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi dewara Timotiusi we depaia rewawa i. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-18">4:9-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio we pui. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1-2" />We Timotiusi neu kumai aneuwiwu aupa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:1-2">Kawio ne na yau Paulusi, Kristus Yesusi ne rasuri ne yau. Ewe rasuri ne mamo tutu Yai Allai ne awia pa, imbaro etopana we kawasa paya parari Yai Allai ne arera we na pampompa derekamana we ingkai tatadu tambengpa na Kristus Yesusi pa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:1-2">Sen Allai kong Yesus Kristusi tane Seni, urong une weweng urona pinoma pa so au, usanewiwu au, kong urong au bodu une wemadori piboki pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Kis. 16:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TI 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi deparanding Allai tutu Timotiusi kong denyauwi we rioaoa na we maitui.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Etopang piboki we Allai, we eyomi wei pai na aneurarong memarang, parari neu apusi woriai pa esomi wei na pampompa. Kong yau eparandeni au wa, mana diru raida etandau pampang we Allai we au. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Aneoa parari rengkarupa na awe etapira warui aupa, impaina aneurarongnei dawia we tupandu taru ea imbaro tarai emararising naria ea. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Aneo nemu roao Kristus Yesusi na pitarai pa, parari tapumu Loisi kong nyamu Eunikei. Mae yau eroaoa we au tato roaoa toyana.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Kis. 16:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Impaina yerekamana we au we bosaera na mambiri Allai ne dona pinoma we aupa we wuwua ea, na awe eruwa waraune so aupa. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Wo Duainunung Mamarang we Allai doni we tata nei, we dong tata tamatai wa mana we dong tata tampaya, kong tasanewiwu tata kong tasanerarong meitui we tantampi piwe unawa pa.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Impaina remu momaya we topang parari tane Seni, mae momaya tutu yau we ewata na wangka pe nina tutu ewuwu Yesusi ne pe. Mana na mambiri Allai dona we aupa, bodu uira pea tutu topang parari Arera Weweng pa mamo paya na uira yani. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Allai piana periri tata warui tane sasari ne kong yau tata imbaro tambengpa tambe nyontarai mamarang. Nyari toyana pa dintatuata na weweng tanarine wa, mana parari pitoai anetatuatapa kong parari ne weweng dona pinoma we tata pa. Ne weng yana dona we tata na Kristus Yesusi, na awe nyari nuneipa wa. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Mae na nina ne, Allai denyawa ne anewiwu tata pa na Kristus Yesusi tane Mampariri ria we tata ma nei. Yesusi piokai kaidapai ne mambiripa kong denyawa topitotoi tambeng ki woroi-woroi pa na ne Arera Weweng pa. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />We etopang parari Arera Weweng nina pa dona, Allai riuwa yau ewuwu kawio pa kong ewe rasuri kong ewe mantanyau pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1Tim. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Aidona mamo yedu uirapa kuira nina, mana emamaya wa tutu yau ereuaroana we matei di eroaoi pa. Yau aneusara we pitoai rioaoa we yau we ewuwuapa I wemambiri we dewuta ra sisu awe nunei ria Menaing na pa. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Anyau wetarai we piana yenyauwa we aupa, rua maitui. Nuari piyana pa na roao Kristus Yesusi na maitui kong anemuwiwu nyontarai. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Na paya Duainunung Mamarang we nyaina tatapai, au bowawu piwe wewengpa we Allai rioaoa we aupa na pitarai.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Au remuaroana we nyontarai endoaoa paya kuira na raora Asia pai piana empika yau eampa. Pigeriusi kong Hermogenesi asaru konta umpika yau.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Mana Onesiporusi kong ne mandarongpai, aino etong aneurarongnei merarising pampang pa. Wo awe enai na wangka rarong pa ki, mana emamayawa we endama endewawa yau pa. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Yana mameariwa, mana na awe donta ma dedu bendari Roma nei pa mamo, i dosaera we yerai yau ki dedu yau. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Kong remuaroana we na Epesusi i piata yau kia. Wento Seni denyawa ne anewiwupa wei na a baba Seni diri nunei we kiutu kawio parari nyontarai ne tata pai.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we riupi we Yesusi mamo, i perari rai memuna riupi na wemai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Impaina Timotiusi, neu kumai pa au, yewara au we bongsaera pampang we paya na Allai ne weweng dona pinoma we tata pa, tutu tambekoiri kong Kristus Yesusi paina. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Pitoai taramoa na yau pa na kawasa endena pa, roaoa we nyontarai wewe emanuanung we etanyau nyontarai eaya pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Au we nyontarai we bua Kristusi Yesusi mamo porari pimamuna we rupi na wemai impaina au andi nukepana na uira we boduta pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Nyontarai pimamuna we nina demuna pai mamo, yemupa we pi nempa wa, imbaro na toyana pa ne komadangpai aneoi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Nyontarai we yenyui bari pa we dedu piwe anong pa, mamo yenyui na wemai parari anang we engkutua we esanyui pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Nyontarai we dong romipai, we meriwa na paya andi ingkai retenang kiutu ne pitatanang we sanang pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Anemukakepana aiwara we pitoai etopana toyanapa, tutu Seni ingkai dona we au anemuatora we pitaupa kia.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Anemu kakepang nina: Yesus Kristusi, we suwi na nyontarai engkada paya, iwo riana mandarong Dauti, ai wuwua kamana na Arera Weweng nei nini. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Tutu Arera Weweng we ewuwui nini aidona ma yedu uirapa, kong etawi waraupa na wai besi parari nyontarai memuna pai, mana Allai Ne Kawiopa ne paya pea we etawiti wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Tutu yanapai, yau emunuara na yeduta piyana pa kuira we nyontarai Allai piana diri ya pa, imbaro ya tato etadu pariri na Yesus Kristusi kong etadu ne wedea we woroi-woroi pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Anyau we yo ekawiora ea nina tarai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Tatoyo tangkada konti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">mamo tata tato ingkai tambeng konti.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Topino tanukepana mamo, tata tato tatairora konti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">mae topino tambeangkari I mamo, I tato ingkai weangkari tata.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat. 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luk. 12:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Topino tanukepana wa, I nukepana pampang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">tutu I wo deduta wa we weangkari Netaraipai.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyau we arota mantanyau emai wa pa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Anemukamana mae topang kamana na kangkuna madui yana we nyontarai paya na Allai renapa, imbaro remo endeo etamindui ya we kawio sosiau pa pe. Wo pitau yana ne una pea wa mana kio munamunai we nyontarai we entaraoa paya. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Anemukangkuna waro Allai reo au we moi na renapa we nyontarai moriwa na momaya wa. Au bonyau na wemai anyau wetarai pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Mana pika au warui kawio we unawa pa kong wemamarang wa pa. Wo kawio yana pa dong nyontarai pa ya emamuna raweina ea. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Kawio etopana pa tatera parari ui kangkeri. Na yapa mamo Himeniusi kong Filetusi asaru tato. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Asaru piana untori warui anyau we wetaraipa na uranyau uroyo a nini Allai piana dong nyontarai ne tata tasuwi warui kaidapa to. Na anyau yana pa donane nyontarai pea endoao Yesusi wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Toyana ki, mana Allai nyari riri amang we meitui we piang na pikodu nina pa aino: “Allai rearong ne nyontarai paya,” kong “matei yau Allai anompa mamo andi waraka pitau weuna wa pa.” <verse eid="2TI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Na manu baba pei mamo dedu piawawa na emasi kong peraki pa memeari wa, mana piawawa we enari na kakopa pa tato. Piawawa weretenang pa na emasi kong peraki pa enari we piwe tadai pa, kong ne we puipa enari we piwe maiyea pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Topino matei rioipi ne taraipai warui pitau we mamuna pa mamo, i ingkai we piawawa na manupai we piwe weweng pa, i memarang, kong Allai reoi we mei we mariwa weng pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Impaina pika nemutaraipai warui maniniawari, we aimomang paya esanerarong mararising we enaripa. Kong bongsaera we bongparari Allai ne awiapa, roao ne kawiopa, anemuwiwu nyontarai, we wieng na madori kong nyontarai we esau Seni paya na anemurarong mamarang. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Pika nemutaraipai warui nyontarai entata we eserai kawio pa ya, tutu ya wo enduinari pianeawa kong emarising we embawari parari anyau we moyawa pa. Anemuaoa we pitau yanapa kio amuna meari ki. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Seni ne Woming we riupi wei pai mamo, dong amuna wa, anerarong weng we nyontarai neya kuira. I andi anemanuanung we denyau nyontarai na wemai kong aneaiwara ete keou pampinoma wa, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />ne kawio pa manaang na etinti nyontarai we embateta ya pa, imbaro Seni dong apea weya we esanetaweri warui ene sasaripa kong endearoang anyau we tarai na Allai pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Na toyanapa ya endearoang ene sasaripa kong entaweri we Allai tutu ya empikara warui Nyombatang warampa we riu ya we etong parari ne awiapa yana.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Nyontarai ne na Awe nu riaki menai nina enari wemoya wa kia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Mesaneaoa we na awe nunei ria ki do menaing ne ingkai nyontarai ne tatadu aseung pau ki. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Nyontarai neya ingkai esaneo mantau ya kong embe woming we pe pa. Ya ingkai esombuari kong etaparanding ya, embe mantatipari, kong etoamuna we ene yai kong nyani ya, kong emaidai esomi we Allai. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Esanewiwu nyontarai eaya wa, emaidai emadori kong nyontarai ea wauya, emararising we engkawio kawio wemoya wa parari nyontarai, empaya wa we entampi we unawa pa, emamuna, emaidai enari pi maipa, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />ya embo nyontarai, esanetatuata woroi wa, esore baba ki, emararising we etong parari pi nunei warui etong parari Allai ne awia pa. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Ya wo enari pararia we ya wo nyontarai esomi we Allai diya, mana na embengpa ya emaidai esomi we Allai. Topira warui nyontarai toyana paya.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Wo na ya, eaya enda na anyuing to nyontarai ene manupa we engkawioaya wawing we endoaoapa piraiwoi paya esanerarongpa. Wawing yasa wo enari sasari pitau, kong esanekangkona pitau wemoyawa pa dauya. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Wawing paya emararising we etadu anyaupa pampang, mana endearoana wami pitarai na Allai pa. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Ya embateta wetarai pa parari Yanesi kong Yambresi asaru na pampompa umbateta Musai pa. Esanetatuatapa manaing kong endoaopa piraiwoi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kel. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Mana etongsaera totoi kia ya endura ayawa, tutu parari pitoai Yanesi kong Yambresi asaru uraduta na pampongpa, ya tato ene tata pa piana denyawa we nyontarai paya kuira.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi denyau Timotius we dongparari pitoai nyaripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Mana Timotiusi au, au piana bong parari neu anyau pa mae pitoai enari ne, pitoai aneuweapa, endoaopa, munuarapa, aneuwiwupa kong neu nukepanapa. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Au tato piana remo yau we engkangkani yau pa kong didiwa we yeduta na bendari Antiokia, Ikoniumi kong na Listra pa. Didiwa pitau yani pai yeduta mae Seni pika yau warui pitau yani pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Kis. 13:14</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:20">14:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Tarai, we matei di yomi we Allai mae wieng kong Kristus Yesusi mamo ingkai dedu didiwa pa tutu nyontarai etong kangkani, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />mana nyontarai weetong amuna kong embeangkakari paya ingkai etamamunai era ea. Ya embeangkari nyontarai peaya mana ya tato nyontarai embeangkari ya. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Mana Timotiusi au, au mamo rukepang anyau wetarai we piana boduta kong roaoa pa, na remuao nyontarai mateai etanyauwa we aupa. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Au andi anemukakepana tato we na awe moia pa au piana remuaroang weraung Mamarang pai to. Kawio we dong anekurayang pa we au mae dinti au to pariri we boduta na roao Kristus Yesusi pa. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Allai ne Weraung Mamarang pitau we nyontarai entoi ne, I ne mambiri pa yumao ya we entoi. Pitau yana pa weuna we denyau tata, we denyawa tane sarara pa, we yua tata kong riwang tane we tatona pa, kong denyau tata we tanari wetarai pa. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Na toyana pa, Allai menyenang ne nyontarai ne koiri-koiri we enari mariwa weweng pa.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Kristusi Yesusi ingkai ria to nunei eama we riu we Mananu kong kiutu kawio parari nyontarai we embeng neya kuira kong we engkada paya kuira. Impaina yerekamana na kangkuna we au na Allai renapa kong Kristusi Yesusi renapa we: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Wuwu Allai ne Arera pa, manyena na a we maipa ete na a we maiwa pae, nyontaraipei nyari sarara pea mamo bonyawa ne sarara pa, wua ya kong bonyau ya na anemuaiwara kong na anyau wetarai pa. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Wo a pei ingkai riama ki, nyontarai pea emaidai etadu anyau we maipa, mana ya ingkai empandu kuru paya parari esanetatuapa we etanyau pi entaraoa mamo weuna na entarakambireipa. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Ya ingkai empoweri entarakambireipa warui kawio we tarai pa kong esepara we araripa. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Toyana ki mana remukakepang nemutaraipai na wemai na pipatotoi ea. Anemuaiwara na didiwapa, nuari mariwa Seni dona we au we wuwu Arera Mamarang pai mae bongparari pitoai nuari we wewomingpa na wemai. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Parari yau mamo, neu rianei piana yararuwi we pikika we Seni kong neu kaida ne piana kikeu to. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Yau piana ekong wawoa na wemai to mae yepaia piana epapa na nu we engkamangnapa to kong yau piana yerara neu eroaoa we Kristusi pa na wemai. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Ninane wiwai tutu embeng na pitarai pa piana manyena demang yau to. Wiwai yana Seni we kiutu kawio na wemai pai dona we yau na awe nunei ria menaing na wane. Wiwai yana pa we yau meari wa mana we nyontarai pitau we etamamang pampang parari awe Seni riama wane.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arera we ra kaipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Bosaera imbaromi rua muraru wu yau ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Tutu Demasi aneo nunei impaina ria warui yau to. I piana depai to Tesalonika. Krekesi piana depai to Garatia mae Titusi depai to Darmatia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Kor. 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal. 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol. 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tit. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm. 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Rukasi memeari di nyai kong yaune. Bonta ma mamo, bontara bodu Markusi we musa tonina ma, tutu i mei we riupata yau na mariwa we erune paina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Kis. 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol. 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm. 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tikikusi wo piana yemi donta to Epesusi eampa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Kis. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Ef. 6:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kol. 4:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Bo bopai ma mamo ko neu asung pampang pai we wiata na Karpusi ne manupai na bendari Troasi kong neu buku pa retenang peino weraung enari na domba rerawa pai.<figure style="fig" file="HK00153C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:13">Weraung Mamarang na pampong pa</figure><verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Aleksanderi wekamasan tembaga pai dong mamuna pa madupei we yau. Seni ingkai dona taweri wei parari we dona we yaupa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Mzm. 62:13; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rm. 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Tim. 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Topianapa autato piaiwara wei, tutu i kewio kangkuna we biateta tane anyaunei pa.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Na awe ebawe yau retenang pa nyontarai pei piata yau wa, ya enda warui yau. Wento Allai dupirandeni ya. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Mana Seni derua yau kong dong paya we yau, imbaromi yau epaya we ewuwu Arera we Weng nei tantenang kong kawasa Yaudi wa paya entaraoa. Kong etapira warui singa woreng pai. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Kong Seni ingkai pika yau warui we moyawa pa. I ingkai periri yau, imbaromi eyua to Ne we riu we Mananu pa na rora-marising. Andi tataparandini ki woroi-woroi. Tarai.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Yong tabea we Priskai kong Akwilai kong we Onesiporusi kong ne mandarong pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Kis. 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16-17">2Tim. 1:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erastusi nyaina Korintusi kong Tropimusi tato yui paina yoni nyaina Miletusi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Kis. 19:22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 20:4">20:4</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rm. 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Bosaera we ruama warui awe Wanang ne aidu wia era pa wia wa. Tabea we rana Ebulusi kong Pudesi kong Linusi kong Klaudiai kong na neta nea kuira. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Wento Seni derua dumuainunungpai. Kong dong Ne weweng dona pinoma pa we mia.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>